            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Series â€˜ASâ€™ Audible Strobe appliances and Series â€˜AHâ€™ Audible appliances or approved equals:  Series â€˜ASâ€™ Audible are listed for  UL Standard 1971 (Emergency Devices for the Hearing-Impaired for Indoor Fire Protection Service).  Series â€˜AHâ€™ Audible are  UL Listed under Standard 464 (Fire Protective Signaling).&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;When synchronization is required, the appliance is compatible with Siemensâ€™ DSC Sync Modules; the Siemens 50-point, 252-point and 504-point fire alarm control panels (FACPs); FireFinder XLS and MXL FACPs, and PAD-3 or PAD-4 NAC Extenders with built-in sync protocol.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
         <dc:creator>
